  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHM 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini Paulo, mfungwa kwa wundu ghwa Kristo Jesu, na mwanidu Timotheo, nakuandikia oho Filemoni mngara odu kwa kazi, dikukunde; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mwanidu wa waka Afia, na Arikipo asikari mngara odu, chiaimweri na ikanisa jiko nyumbenyi kwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wakol. 4.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mvono ndeghukaie konyu na sere ifumagha kwa Mlungu Aba na Bwana odu Jesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lukundo lwa Filemoni na irumirio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula ngelo iji nakalomba, nadakukumbuka ngimfunyira Mlungu wapo chawucha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa kukaia nawuyasikira malagho gha irumirio kuko najo kwa Bwana Jesu, na lukundo kuko nalo kwa waeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani naawuyalomba angu wungara diko nagho aighu ya irumirio jako, ghurede kumanya agho mecha ghedu diko nagho andenyi ya Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neko na kuboilwa kubaa na kukumbwa ngolo ni lukundo lwako mwanidu, kwa kukaia kwawuyawihoresha waeli ngolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi kwa wundu ghwa Onesimo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho, hata ngera neko na wuwana andenyi ya Kristo ghokulaghira kubonye seji ikundikie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elaima kwa wundu ghwa lukundo, nawona nibonye ilombi kwako. Ini Paulo, mdumwa wa Kristo Jesu, na idana ne mfungwa kwa wundu ghwake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabonya ilombi kwako kwa wundu ghwa mwanwapo Onesimo, uo nimvae kiroho niko kifungonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wakol. 4.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Uo imbiri orekoghe usene fwaida ingi kwako, ela idana oko na fwaida kwako na kwapo wori).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naawuyammbunja kwako, nao moni ni ngolo yapo cheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboilwagha ngera nadakanya nao, upate kunidumikia wulalo ghwako ingelo niko kifungonyi kwa wundu ghwa Ilagho Jiboie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela neewona nisebonye ilagho jingi kuserumirie; isechekaia wucha ghwako kwaaghubonya kwa suti, ela ikaie ni kwa kukunda kwako kumoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kewada ihi niyo shekeria moretaneghe na Onesimo kwa ngelo, eri kuchekanya nao toe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si sa mzumba sena anduangi, ela waboie kuchumba mzumba; uo ni mwanidu mkundwa, hasa kwapo, ela kwako ni kuchumba; kwa mumbi na kwa Bwana wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho, ikakaia kuwonagha ne mngara wako, kummbuse sa ini moni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia ukukosere kwa ilagho jingi, angu kukaia na sile ingi yako, kunilawie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini Paulo, naandika malagho agha kwa mkonu ghwapo nimoni; nichalipa. Da ima niakughoria? Nechi kwaichi putu kukaia nakulawiagha hata nafsi yako wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mwanidu nechi nani moni nakunde fwaida imu kwako andenyi ya Bwana. Nihoreshe ngolo yapo andenyi ya Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuandikia niko na wuloli angu kuchanisikira; ngimanya angu kuchabonya mengi kuchumba agho naghora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiaimweri na agho, kuniboisire chumba cha waghenyi, angu nawuyasuwiria kwa chia ya malombi ghenyu, mchanipata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Voro ra kutua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafra, mfungwa andwamweri nani kwa wundu ghwa Kristo Jesu, wakuroghua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wakol. 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wokoni Marko, Aristariko, Dema, na Luka, wangara wapo wa kazi, wakuroghua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
